# Retire policy 2026-11-20: still in production in 2026 with no announced end; retire dates commented out. Revisit when an end is announced.
# Nissan Micra K15 five-door electric hatchback, 2025 onwards.
#
# The AmpR-platform electric Micra, built at Renault Douai: the rounded
# five-door with the blanked nose, the slim lamp signature and the two-tone
# roof options. Nissan GB opened the UK order bank on 1 September 2025 and
# customer deliveries began in the first quarter of 2026. Five-door only.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nissan_Micra
#
# Dimensions 3.974 x 1.830 x 1.499 m, wheelbase 2.541 m (Nissan GB pricing
# release, 5 August 2025, dimensions table; the 2.020 m with-mirrors figure
# is the one quoted in the press text).
#
# Shape reference: NO true level side elevation was obtainable. Image 1 is a
# front three-quarter about 30-35 degrees off the side axis, so the flank is
# estimated within the published dimensions and the limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (b), the Nissan GB launch release of 21 May 2025: Pure
# White, Elegant Silver, Mystery Black, Noble Marine, Authentic Blue and
# Rebel Red, in 14 two-tone combinations. Weights 12, 10, 9, 8, total 39,
# provisional.
#
# Speed 150 km/h, an estimate for this car; no published UK top speed was
# recorded in the research. Comfort 80/450, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 80.
# Class 1.
# Dates: intro September 2025, when the UK order bank opened; retire dates
# commented out (still in production in 2026).
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/nissan-micra-k15.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/nissan-micra-k15.dae. References:
# citycars/references/nissan-micra-k15/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: no orthographic flank reference exists, so the side
# stations and the overhang split are estimates. A black two-tone roof is fixed
# on this master. Body curvature, door sculpting and lamp internals are
# simplified.


obj=citycar
name=NissanMicraK15(PureWhite)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=12
intro_year=2025
intro_month=9
#retire_year=2048
#retire_month=6
speed=150
class=1
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=80
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=450

Image[E]=./images/nissan-micra-k15-purewhite_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/nissan-micra-k15-purewhite_SE.0.0,-13,0
Image[S]=./images/nissan-micra-k15-purewhite_S.0.0,0,0
Image[SW]=./images/nissan-micra-k15-purewhite_SW.0.0,-8,10
Image[W]=./images/nissan-micra-k15-purewhite_W.0.0,4,5
Image[NW]=./images/nissan-micra-k15-purewhite_NW.0.0,12,10
Image[N]=./images/nissan-micra-k15-purewhite_N.0.0,0,33
